  "slug": "why-learning-chinese",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1373_why-learning-chinese.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My Chinese friends often ask me, “Why are you learning Chinese?” Because I love traveling, and speaking Chinese makes it much easier to travel in China. These days, you can travel in China without knowing Chinese, but if you speak it, you can chat with Chinese people and learn about Chinese culture. I really like China, and I’d like to work there too."
  ],
  "english_full": "My Chinese friends often ask me, “Why are you learning Chinese?” Because I love traveling, and speaking Chinese makes it much easier to travel in China. These days, you can travel in China without knowing Chinese, but if you speak it, you can chat with Chinese people and learn about Chinese culture. I really like China, and I’d like to work there too.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мои кита́йские дру́зья ча́сто спра́шивают меня́: “Почему́ ты учи́шь кита́йский?” Потому что я люблю́ пое́здки, и говори́ть на кита́йском де́лает путеше́ствия в Кита́е намно́го легче. В после́днее вре́мя вы можете путеше́ствовать по Кита́ю без зна́ния кита́йского, но если вы го́ворите на нём, вы можете бесе́довать с кита́йскими лю́дьми и изуча́ть кита́йскую культу́ру. Мне де́йствительно нра́вится Китай, и я бы хотел́ рабо́тать там тóже."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Moí kitáyskie drúz'ya chásto spráshivayut meńya: “Pocheḿu ty uch́ish' kitáyskiy?” Potomu chto ya lyublýu poiézdki, i govorít' na kitáyskom délayet puteshestviya v Kitáye namnógo légche. V poslédnee vreḿya vy mozhete puteshestvovat' po Kitáyu bez znániya kitáyskogo, no esli vy govoríte na ném, vy mozhete besedovat' s kitáyskimi lyud́mi i izuchát' kitáyskúyu kul'túru. Mne déystvitel'no nrávitsya Kitáy, i ya by khoteĺ rabotat́ tam tózhe."
  ],
